    "Three-finger click is unavailable right now. Hover it to see why.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding playground caption under the gesture chips when Three-finger click can't work; 'it' = that chip",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klick mit drei Fingern ist gerade nicht verfügbar. Fahre darüber, um zu sehen, warum."
          }
        },
        "es": {
